**Wave 1.** Three directions run in parallel.
- Deepen weakest claim 1: Lyman-alpha thermal-relic bound m_th >5.3-5.7 keV robustness to IGM thermal history priors and emulator systematics.
- Deepen weakest claim 2: DW sterile-neutrino mass mapping m_s=4.43 keV (m_th/1keV)^{4/3} and X-ray vs Lyman-alpha binding constraint on f_s=1.
- Background literature check: mixed cold+warm DM loophole and Planck/BBN complementarity to pure WDM bound.
